@host = http://localhost:5080
@categoryId = 7c1d0f52-3a55-4b0e-8d61-2f0a9e4b1c01
@habitId = 5e9b7a10-6c2d-4f3a-9b84-1d7e3c5a2b02

### 1. Реєстрація
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Test User", "email": "test@example.com", "password": "Passw0rd!" }

### 2. Вхід — токен збережеться в змінну
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "test@example.com", "password": "Passw0rd!" }

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.accessToken); client.global.set("refresh", response.body.refreshToken); %}

### 3. Категорія (upsert)
PUT {{host}}/api/categories/{{categoryId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Study", "colorHex": "#4C8BF5", "icon": "book", "clientUpdatedAtUtc": "2026-11-10T08:00:00Z" }

### 4. Список категорій / дельта
GET {{host}}/api/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{host}}/api/categories?modifiedSince=2026-11-01T00:00:00Z
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Завдання (Id генерує клієнт), з EstimatedMinutes і категорією
PUT {{host}}/api/tasks/3f2b8a56-8a3e-4c1e-9a55-0b6f3d0c1a01
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Submit report before deadline",
  "description": null,
  "deadlineUtc": "2026-11-20T12:00:00Z",
  "priority": 3,
  "categoryId": "{{categoryId}}",
  "reminderAtUtc": null,
  "completedAtUtc": null,
  "estimatedMinutes": 90,
  "subtasks": [ { "id": "aa111111-0000-4000-8000-000000000001", "title": "Draft", "isDone": true } ],
  "clientUpdatedAtUtc": "2026-11-10T10:00:00Z"
}

### 5a. Відкладання: той самий запит із пізнішим дедлайном → подія TaskPostponed
PUT {{host}}/api/tasks/3f2b8a56-8a3e-4c1e-9a55-0b6f3d0c1a01
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Submit report before deadline",
  "description": null,
  "deadlineUtc": "2026-11-22T12:00:00Z",
  "priority": 3,
  "categoryId": "{{categoryId}}",
  "reminderAtUtc": null,
  "completedAtUtc": null,
  "estimatedMinutes": 90,
  "subtasks": [],
  "clientUpdatedAtUtc": "2026-11-10T11:00:00Z"
}

### 5b. Виконання → подія TaskCompleted
PUT {{host}}/api/tasks/3f2b8a56-8a3e-4c1e-9a55-0b6f3d0c1a01
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Submit report before deadline",
  "description": null,
  "deadlineUtc": "2026-11-22T12:00:00Z",
  "priority": 3,
  "categoryId": "{{categoryId}}",
  "reminderAtUtc": null,
  "completedAtUtc": "2026-11-10T12:30:00Z",
  "estimatedMinutes": 90,
  "subtasks": [],
  "clientUpdatedAtUtc": "2026-11-10T12:30:00Z"
}

### 6. Список завдань / дельта
GET {{host}}/api/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{host}}/api/tasks?modifiedSince=2026-11-01T00:00:00Z
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. Звичка (щодня)
PUT {{host}}/api/habits/{{habitId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Morning run",
  "description": null,
  "frequencyType": 0,
  "daysOfWeekMask": 0,
  "timesPerWeek": null,
  "reminderTime": "07:30:00",
  "colorHex": "#5BB97C",
  "icon": "run",
  "categoryId": null,
  "clientUpdatedAtUtc": "2026-11-10T08:00:00Z"
}

### 8. Відмітка за день (тіло необов'язкове); повтор не дублює подію
PUT {{host}}/api/habits/{{habitId}}/logs/2026-11-10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
PUT {{host}}/api/habits/{{habitId}}/logs/2026-11-09
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "completedAtUtc": "2026-11-09T06:45:00Z" }

### 9. Зняти відмітку
DELETE {{host}}/api/habits/{{habitId}}/logs/2026-11-09
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 10. Звички / дельта
GET {{host}}/api/habits
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{host}}/api/habits?modifiedSince=2026-11-01T00:00:00Z
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 11. Видалення (м'яке)
DELETE {{host}}/api/tasks/3f2b8a56-8a3e-4c1e-9a55-0b6f3d0c1a01
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
DELETE {{host}}/api/categories/{{categoryId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
DELETE {{host}}/api/habits/{{habitId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 12. Оновлення токенів
POST {{host}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{ "refreshToken": "{{refresh}}" }